WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.960
Is the air in Iceland safe to breathe right now?

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.120
Air quality is measured by one agency. Wind, by another.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.550
AirCast Iceland puts them together on one map.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:16.280
Pick a station, like Grensás in Reykjavík. Right now: moderate.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:22.220
Nitrogen dioxide is the reason. At 10:00 this morning, it reached poor.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:29.340
And the wind shows where it's going: 4 metres a second, from the south-southeast.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.410
Iceland's air and wind, live.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.580
AirCast Iceland. Try it now.
